9,"Full text of ""enwiki-Lamkang_language-20200726.pdf""",https://archive.org/stream/enwiki-Lamkang_language-20200726.pdf/enwiki-Lamkang_language-20200726_djvu.txt,"Lamkang is a Naga language spoken by Lamkang Naga of Manipur, India, with one village in Burma. The Lamkangs are mostly settled in the southwest and southeastern parts of Manipur.Language. family. Sino-Tibetan.",Lamkang,Sino-Tibetan
